OL,3,AMoments of silence mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FVice-President JD Vance and all living
OL,8,Fformer US presidents are at the
OL,9,Fceremony - here's a look at how the
OL,10,Fattacks are being remembered throughout
OL,11,Fthe day
OL,13,FOn 11 September 2001, a total of 2,977
OL,14,Fpeople were killed - about 2,700 died
OL,15,Fafter hijackers crashed two planes into
OL,16,Fthe Twin Towers of the World Trade
OL,17,FCenter
